      "message": "1. As L165 in CheckChangeWasUploaded() shows, the check takes effect only if `input_api.is_committing` is set.\n\n2. If one runs `git cl presubmit`, it runs the presubmit checks for committing. If the intent was to run presubmit hooks for uploads, jj should run `git cl presubmit --upload`.\nhttps://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/tools/depot_tools/+/main:git_cl.py;l\u003d5056-5059\n\n3. If jj runs `git cl presubmit --upload`, is_committing will be set to false, and it should be fine.\n\nI\u0027m leaning towards updating jj to pass `--upload` to presubmit, because there might be other presubmit checks alternating the behaviour if `is_committing` is set.",
